api.github.com/users/yinsn/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yinsn/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yinsn/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yinsn/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yinsn/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yinsn/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"content_type":"text/plain; charset=utf-8","state":"uploaded","size":867,"digest":"sha256:b88375e2a44d43d2ac1e4efdd9012a96883c60f34313dd864dfecb277678f371","download_count":0,"created_at":"2026-10-25T02:44:17Z","updated_at":"2026-10-25T02:44:17Z","browser_download_url":"https://github.com/yinsn/FreeJot-Updates/releases/download/v0.4.5/UPDATE.zh-CN.txt"}],"tarball_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yinsn/FreeJot-Updates/tarball/v0.4.5","zipball_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yinsn/FreeJot-Updates/zipball/v0.4.5","body":"# 释手 0.4.5\n\n本次修复微信听写上屏兼容问题，继续复用现有模型。\n\n- 微信改为直接调用原生「粘贴」菜单命令，不再向微信发送模拟 Command+V，避开只输入字母 V 的情况。\n- 菜单查找、目标核对和执行粘贴分别使用有界时间预算，避免正常的跨进程查询耗尽粘贴时间。\n- 每次只执行一次粘贴。菜单不可用、目标变化或操作未确认时保留文字，不改用模拟按键重试，以免出现单独的 V 或重复输入。\n- F16／脚踏板、识别与整理模型及个人设置保持原有用法。0.4.4 的历史恢复、词库维护和回填保护继续保留。\n\n在「设置 → 关于释手 → 检查更新」升级，无需重新下载模型。首次安装仍使用完整 0.2.4 包，再更新到 0.4.5。\n"}
